units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

read_data ethanol_liquid.data

pair_style metatomic pet-mad.pt device cuda
pair_coeff * * 1 6 8

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes one 20000 page 2000000

# 1) relieve the close contacts introduced by isotropically scaling the
#    loosely-packed box down to the true liquid density
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 200 1000

# 2) short NVT equilibration at 300 K to check stability and measure
#    real per-step wall time for this system size / model
reset_timestep 0
timestep 0.0005
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.05

thermo 20
thermo_style custom step time temp pe etotal press

run 2000
